  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Butter a 20cm (8-inch) gratin dish.",
    "Cut the Ukrainian rye bread into small cubes and set aside.",
    "Sauté the mushrooms, onions, and garlic in butter until softened.",
    "Add the vegetable broth and bring to a simmer.",
    "Stir in the quenched cheese until melted and smooth.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Combine the bread cubes and mushroom mixture.",
    "Transfer the mixture to the prepared gratin dish.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot."
